# Prompt
Every single check should implement interface OneSviCheck
and thus it should implement one method 'check'
(of course, it can have any number of private methods internally)
All the error messages must be collected and returned in the errors[] array
of the checkResults resulting variable.

Recommended imports:
```ts
import ParsedSviDirectory from "../sviParser/parsedSviDirectory";
import { SVIFile, SviFileToLoad } from "../types";
import { checkResults, OneSviCheck } from "./types";